[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5401.51, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "text": "在这里，你可能会看到他正在做生意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5404.87, "timestamp": "01:30:04", "text": "在猪头酒吧。他是一位值得信赖的金属"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5407.59, "timestamp": "01:30:07", "text": "拖车。好的。提到我们谈过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5410.31, "timestamp": "01:30:10", "text": "他提防女巫是可以理解的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5413.51, "timestamp": "01:30:13", "text": "还有巫师，甚至像你这么小的巫师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5415.03, "timestamp": "01:30:15", "text": "也就是说，如果您正在寻找"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5416.95, "timestamp": "01:30:16", "text": "关于伦洛克的信息，有助于控制他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5420.31, "timestamp": "01:30:20", "text": "在这里，你会发现洛戈克是你的盟友。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5423.43, "timestamp": "01:30:23", "text": "好的。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5426.629, "timestamp": "01:30:26", "text": "谢谢你，塞雷娜。如果你找到了戈克大人，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5429.43, "timestamp": "01:30:29", "text": "请代我向他问好。把我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5431.03, "timestamp": "01:30:31", "text": "最好的。好的。我不知道你有什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5434.43, "timestamp": "01:30:34", "text": "这样做是为了树立如此强大的敌人，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5440.75, "timestamp": "01:30:40", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5454.189, "timestamp": "01:30:54", "text": "请问，我可以进去吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5457.189, "timestamp": "01:30:57", "text": "是的。这是什么地方？就像"}]